{"id":"vod_sn_36808","vodId":"36808","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"CodeRealize 创世的公主","name_cn":"CodeRealize 创世的公主","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/d492d9d0855d4dbd818b32ea6e2a1d43.jpg"},"summary":"卡尔迪娅（早见沙织 配音）表面看来只是一个平凡的少女，但实际上全身上下都有着能将一切被触碰到的物体腐蚀的剧毒，这样的她终日生活在孤独之中，还遭到了军方的逮捕。一次偶然中，卡尔迪娅邂逅了名为罗宾（前野智昭 配音）的大盗，开朗乐观过于自信的他并不害怕卡尔迪娅身上的剧毒，两人结伴而行，前往伦敦，在那里，隐藏着卡尔迪娅的身世之谜。　　一路上，卡尔迪娅和罗宾遇见了形形色色的同伴们。吸血鬼猎人范海辛（诹访部顺一 配音）、智商超群冷静和善的弗兰肯斯坦（柿原彻也 配音）、有些轻浮但拥有超高智商的巴比康（森久保祥太郎 配音）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:46:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1HHWeSLd141/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Uhdj42RASs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/88uprpfbnV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uQ4n3XcJjx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZM7xYWPxct1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5LP1ysE0Jg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XaTTHAQMyD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rhtBCkHdQY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bbSA5HJMWa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yqqHDVv0Rm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UGx70YEPLv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/26v0bR4wpX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tPnD5ZeZgE1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:18.488Z"}